# ── GitHub JSON storage (Phase 7) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# A PRIVATE GitHub repo holds the data file. Unlike FTrack, reads are
# authenticated too, because this file contains body weight and measurements.
# These coordinates are not secret; the PAT is, and it never goes in here —
# each phone pastes it once at /settings and it stays in that browser.
VITE_GH_OWNER=
VITE_GH_REPO=gm2-data
VITE_GH_BRANCH=main
VITE_GH_PATH=data.json

# Leave the values above empty to run fully local (localStorage only).
